<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<meta name="description" content="D5 bundle demo page">
<title>D5 Bundle Demo</title>
<style>
:root{--gap:16px;--fg:#1a1a1a;--muted:#666;--btn:#0b62d6;--btn-hover:#084fae;--err:#b3261e}
*{box-sizing:border-box}
body{margin:0;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,"PingFang SC","Microsoft YaHei",sans-serif;color:var(--fg);line-height:1.6;background:#fafafa}
main{max-width:640px;margin:48px auto;padding:24px;background:#fff;border:1px solid #e5e5e5;border-radius:12px}
h1{margin:0 0 8px;font-size:28px}
p.sub{margin:0 0 var(--gap);color:var(--muted)}
button{padding:10px 20px;font-size:16px;border:0;border-radius:8px;background:var(--btn);color:#fff;cursor:pointer;transition:background .15s ease,transform .1s ease}
button:hover{background:var(--btn-hover)}
button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #9ec1ff;outline-offset:2px}
button:active{transform:translateY(1px)}
button:disabled{opacity:.5;cursor:not-allowed}
#msg{margin-top:var(--gap);min-height:1.6em}
#msg.error{color:var(--err)}
.empty{margin-top:12px;padding:12px;border:1px dashed #ccc;border-radius:8px;color:var(--muted);font-size:14px}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<main>
<h1>D5 Bundle Demo</h1>
<p class="sub">点击按钮验证交互；断网或异常时此处显示错误提示。</p>
<button type="button" id="go" aria-label="开始演示">开始</button>
<div id="msg" role="status" aria-live="polite"></div>
<div class="empty" id="empty">空态：暂无运行记录，点击「开始」生成一条。</div>
</main>
<script>
(function(){
var btn=document.getElementById('go'),msg=document.getElementById('empty'),st=document.getElementById('msg');
btn.addEventListener('click',function(){
btn.disabled=true;st.textContent='';st.className='';
try{
var n=new Date().toLocaleString('zh-CN');
msg.textContent='运行记录：'+n+' flashing ok.';
}catch(e){st.textContent='错误：运行失败，请重试。('+String(e&&e.message||e)+')';st.className='error';}
btn.disabled=false;
});
})();
</script>
</body>
</html>
